{
"k": "16796",
"who": "GREN",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_bartriptrap",
"en": "{StonedA}I wanna clear the air. We're all in this dungheap of a {StonedB}fuckin' shit town together, and we're all gonna have a toast. {StonedA}All of us."
},
{
"k": "16797",
"who": "GREN",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_bartriptrap",
"en": "{SadA}Yes, he did, he certainly did, {TiredA}but lemme tell you something."
