"k": "16802",
"who": "WOODSMAN",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_bartriptrap",
"en": "And he said that he shouldn't mix it with alcohol."
},
{
"k": "16803",
"who": "GREN",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_bartriptrap",
"en": "So, c'mon... have a drink with me."
