"en": "{AngryB}I don't wanna get loaded with him."
},
{
"k": "16809",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_bartriptrap",
"en": "[Drink]"
},
{
"k": "16810",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_bartriptrap",
"en": "I'm just here on business, Gren. I can't."
},
